<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-EASTERN PROVINCE V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-EASTERN PROVINCE V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the opening</p>
<p>day of the three-day match between Eastern Province and India at</p>
<p>St George's Park on Saturday:</p>
<p>India first innings</p>
<p> V.Rathore c Morgan b Ferreira	  71</p>
<p> W.Raman c Shaw b Botha		   15</p>
<p> S.Ganguly not out			  90</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar not out			 9</p>
<p> Extras (b-6 lb-8 nb-7 w-4)	     25</p>
<p> Total (for two wickets)		 210</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-37 2-179</p>
<p>To bat: M.Azharuddin, R.Dravid, N.Mongia, D.Ganesh,</p>
<p>D.Johnson, V.Raju, V.Prasad.</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): Hayward 14-4-27-0 (2-w 4-nb), Botha</p>
<p>15-3-44-1 (2-w 3-nb), Ferreira 13-2-49-1, Callaghan 12-5-19-0,</p>
<p>Shaw 15.4-3-57-0.</p>
<p>Eastern Province - P.Amm, A.Prince, L.Koen, K.Wessels,</p>
<p>D.Callaghan, M.Rushmere, G.Morgan, T.Shaw, Q.Ferreira,</p>
<p>M.Haywood, W.Botha.</p>
